⍝ Transpose.tc
⍝ ════════════

⍝@ test4.

      ⎕IO←1

      ⍝ Precond: A simple scalar/vector nonneg integer; implicit ⎕IO
      ⍝ inv: ⍴Z ←→ (⍴B)[⍋A]
      ⍝ inv: ⍴⍴Z ←→ ⍴⍴B
      B ← ⎕RVAL 3 (2 3 4) (,0 1 0 0 0)
      A ← 2 3 1                               ⍝ permutation of ⍳3
      Z ← A⍉B
      (⍴Z) ≡ (⍴B)[⍋A]
1
      (⍴⍴Z) ≡ ⍴⍴B
1
      ⍝ inv: ⍉B ←→ (⌽⍳⍴⍴B)⍉B   (reversed axes = monadic transpose)
      B ← ⎕RVAL 3 (2 3 4) (,0 1 0 0 0)
      (⍉B) ≡ (⌽⍳⍴⍴B)⍉B
1
